  "description_short": "Harbour-side eatery in Knysna serving fresh seafood and grills with waterfront views.",
  "description_long": "Mane By The Sea sits right on Knysna's working harbour, offering front-row seats to the comings and goings of boats and the daily rhythm of the waterfront. The menu leans into fresh local seafood – line fish, calamari, and prawns feature prominently – alongside steaks and burgers for those who prefer turf to surf. It's a relaxed spot where you can enjoy a leisurely lunch or early dinner while watching the sunset over the lagoon.\n\nThe setting is casual and unfussy, making it a good choice for families or anyone wanting a laid-back meal after exploring Knysna's attractions. Service is friendly, and the kitchen delivers honest, well-prepared dishes without pretension. The location alone – steps from the Knysna Heads and the heart of the harbour precinct – makes it worth a visit, especially if you're staying nearby or spending the day around the waterfront.",
